how 2 build:

this project is set up to cross compile for arm1176jzf-s

the rpi zero w 1.1 sysroot is included in this repo in take a guess where
you will need clang, compiler-rt, lld, cmake and ninja

i would use cmake and ninja:

mkdir build && cd build
cmake -GNinja -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=../zero.toolchain.cmake ..
ninja
